    <string name="setup_title">Welcome to OpenCMR2</string>
    <string name="setup_intro">OpenCMR2 plays your copy of Colin McRae Rally 2.0 for PC. Copy its installation folder to this device, then choose it here. The game files are copied into the app, about 700 MB, only once.</string>
    <string name="setup_where">The folder needs Game, FrontEnd and Sounds. You can also choose a folder that contains it. Files on a CD or ISO need to be installed or extracted first.</string>
